{
    "version": 6,
    "bundle": "IHA47HKULXMNHVBTXU27YLYMY6TLDOG6",
    "type": "home",
    "storyId": "00001021118001",
    "title": "0",
    "enTitle": "",
    "text": [
        {
            "jpName": "スティルインラブ",
            "enName": "Still in Love",
            "jpText": "アルヴさん、この後、\nお時間は空いてますでしょうか？",
            "enText": "Arve, could you spare us some of your time? \ndo you have free time right now?",
            "nextBlock": 2,
            "voiceIdx": 0,
            "pathId": -4945341842964656864,
            "blockIdx": 1
        },
        {
            "jpName": "スティルインラブ",
            "enName": "Still in Love",
            "jpText": "お誕生日会をしようと、皆で\n準備をしていますので、よろしければぜひ。",
            "enText": "We thought we'd hold a birthday party \ntogether, and just finished preparations. \nIt would be lovely if you could come.",
            "nextBlock": 3,
            "voiceIdx": 1,
            "pathId": 3664063504111355594,
            "blockIdx": 2
        },
        {
            "jpName": "アドマイヤグルーヴ",
            "enName": "Admire Groove",
            "jpText": "誕生日会？\n……ああ、他にも誕生日の近い子がいるのね。",
            "enText": "A birthday party? …Ah, there <i>are</i>\nmany upcoming birthdays.",
            "nextBlock": 4,
            "voiceIdx": 2,
            "pathId": -813411626440464637,
            "blockIdx": 3
        },
        {
            "jpName": "アドマイヤグルーヴ",
            "enName": "Admire Groove",
            "jpText": "少しだけ顔を出して、すぐに行くわ。\nひと通り終わったら……あとは他の子の\nお祝いでもしてて。",
            "enText": "I don't mind dropping by… for a moment. \nYou can go ahead and celebrate the others' \nthen.",
            "nextBlock": 5,
            "voiceIdx": 3,
            "pathId": 530134652001022887,
            "blockIdx": 4
        },
        {
            "jpName": "スティルインラブ",
            "enName": "Still in Love",
            "jpText": "……え？　他の子？",
            "enText": "…Huh? The others'?",
            "nextBlock": 6,
            "voiceIdx": 4,
            "pathId": 8803706034692109305,
            "blockIdx": 5
        },
        {
            "jpName": "アドマイヤグルーヴ",
            "enName": "Admire Groove",
            "jpText": "ええ。――え？",
            "enText": "Uh-huh… huh?",
            "nextBlock": 7,
            "voiceIdx": 5,
            "pathId": 2233974154074827530,
            "blockIdx": 6
        },
        {
            "jpName": "スティルインラブ",
            "enName": "Still in Love",
            "jpText": "ええと、他の子……はいらっしゃいません。\nアルヴさんのお誕生日会ですので。",
            "enText": "Ummm, there… aren't any others. \nIt's a birthday party for you, Arve.",
            "nextBlock": 8,
            "voiceIdx": 6,
            "pathId": 3867784139982143697,
            "blockIdx": 7
        },
        {
            "jpName": "アドマイヤグルーヴ",
            "enName": "Admire Groove",
            "jpText": "……あ――\n合同の誕生日会じゃないってこと？",
            "enText": "…Ah… You mean to say it's not \na joint birthday party?",
            "nextBlock": 9,
            "voiceIdx": 7,
            "pathId": -3249644155781436646,
            "blockIdx": 8
        },
        {
            "jpName": "アドマイヤグルーヴ",
            "enName": "Admire Groove",
            "jpText": "（…………――そっか。\nそう、なんでしょうね……普通は）",
            "enText": "(……Of course. That's… the norm, isn't it.)",
            "nextBlock": 10,
            "voiceIdx": 8,
            "pathId": -525329665659436394,
            "blockIdx": 9
        },
        {
            "jpName": "アドマイヤグルーヴ",
            "enName": "Admire Groove",
            "jpText": "誕生日会――私だけの……。",
            "enText": "A birthday party… just for me…",
            "nextBlock": 11,
            "voiceIdx": 9,
            "pathId": -8941896277699274804,
            "blockIdx": 10
        },
        {
            "jpName": "スティルインラブ",
            "enName": "Still in Love",
            "jpText": "お茶もお菓子も、\nアルヴさんのためだけに用意しています。あ、\n『本日の主役』たすきもあったような……。",
            "enText": "We've prepared tea and sweets \nfor you as well. Ah, I believe I also \nsaw a \"Birthday Girl\" sash…",
            "nextBlock": 12,
            "voiceIdx": 10,
            "pathId": -4060199782919885987,
            "blockIdx": 11
        },
        {
            "jpName": "アドマイヤグルーヴ",
            "enName": "Admire Groove",
            "jpText": "それは……いらない。とりあえず、\n顔だけ出せばいいんでしょ。案内して。",
            "enText": "That… I do not need. Well, I can \nshow up at least. Lead the way.",
            "nextBlock": 13,
            "voiceIdx": 11,
            "pathId": 6047112479598738841,
            "blockIdx": 12
        },
        {
            "jpName": "アドマイヤグルーヴ",
            "enName": "Admire Groove",
            "jpText": "（…………変なの。\n――私だけが、『主役』、なんて……）",
            "enText": "(…Standing out as the only \"birthday girl\"? \nWhat a strange feeling…)",
            "nextBlock": -1,
            "voiceIdx": 12,
            "pathId": -1160766313031734486,
            "blockIdx": 13
        }
    ],
    "modified": 1777642024,
    "humanTl": true
}